            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BIGRED227"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Excellent. I usually don't like to rate unless I've followed the recipe exactly, but I followed some of the suggestions from others and they were great. I cut way down on the olive oil, all the way to 1/4 cup, added 1 extra clove of garlic, and some roasted red pepper. I didn't add any parmesan, because frankly I forgot. It tasted a little vinegary so I added another 1/8 cup of olive oil and I wish I hadn't. By the time everything mixed, the vinegar taste wasn't as overpowering, but it was a little oily.",
            "datePublished": "2007-03-19T10:09:49.090Z"
          },
          {
